 "interface": {
  "sees": "One driver's-eye camera (320 × 240, 90° wide, a picture on each request), the car's own position, speed and attitude estimate, its wheels, air tanks and pressures, and the judges' scores after each run.",
  "controls": "Ten air-jet valves, the rear-wheel motors, brakes and steering, in commands of 10 ms up to 1 s, in real time. Every jump, flip and landing is the agent's own program.",
  "moment": "GPT-6 Astra's best jump of the medal series (run 5 of its third match, 149 points): roll left, back flip, roll right. Here the car is upside down at the top of the back flip, high over the parked cars; a jet's plume shows at the edge of the driver's view.",
  "camera": {
